			"name": "Innate Attack",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Zoanthrope's forehead crackles with the psychic bolt it is about to release, aimed with the same drilled precision as any trained psyker's Innate Attack skill.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Beam) (DX/E, B269) at DX+2 (12) for 4 points, Easy — the skill Warp Blast's Burning-type Innate Attack build calls for.",
